Well, there I was on level 2, with my idiotic Tourist, Fred, and
I was getting quite frustrated when Fred fell victim to about every
possible catastrophe that wouldn't kill him... and I found an
interesting way to rob shops that I have never seen posted before,
so here goes:

SPOILER ALERT

I was in this scroll shop, getting more and more irritated, so I
decided to grab all the scrolls and read one, in the hope of getting
a teleportation scroll. But noooooo, they were all scrolls of light,
destroy armor, and other equally useless stuff. And the last scroll 
I read was a punishment scroll. AAAAAAHHHHH! Now, trapped in the shop
with no way to pay and no hope of killing the shopkeeper, I grabbed
the iron ball and threw myself out of the shop! It worked!

Of course the Kops and shopkeeper chased me down and killed me,
but I discovered this neat trick along the way, which made Fred's
pathetic life somewhat more worthwhile.

